    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>PALPUS X ANNIHILATION\u00a0</u></strong><strong>is an OLDSCHOOL ISOMETRIC ACTION SHOOTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thousands of alien monsters are waiting to be splattered. Use every tool at your disposal and get the job done!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/2cc86606ed36afe463282a2847f20feb.poster.avif?t=1755029730\" width=722 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/2cc86606ed36afe463282a2847f20feb.webm?t=1755029730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/2cc86606ed36afe463282a2847f20feb.mp4?t=1755029730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/b53173c186e904aeac1e607dba93b858.avif?t=1755029730\" width=799 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight <strong>hundreds of aliens</strong> with different abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>Campaign</strong> and <strong>Horde Mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood, bodies, bullet casings.. all <strong>decals stay forever!</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over a dozen weapons like <strong>Shotguns, Chainguns and Plasmarifles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic light</strong> system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different locations and find <strong>secret areas</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>explosives and turrets</strong> to your advantage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill up</strong> your characters abilities: Health, Strength, Accuracy and Speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave nothing but a bloody mess behind!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/b53173c186e904aeac1e607dba93b858.avif?t=1755029730\" width=799 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/2db5348f226318a858e9d72f8307b09e.poster.avif?t=1755029730\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/2db5348f226318a858e9d72f8307b09e.webm?t=1755029730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968860/extras/2db5348f226318a858e9d72f8307b09e.mp4?t=1755029730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >(Ohh and there's also a story):</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The company has assigned you to investigate the sudden halt in communication from one of their high-tech research facilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They've picked up some strange bio-signals down there...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
